      "html": "<ul><li><strong>Scientific name:</strong> Entomocorus benjamini Eigenmann, 1917</li><li><strong>Family:</strong> Auchenipteridae</li><li><strong>Common names:</strong> Sleeper Catfish, Schlafwels (Germany)</li><li><strong>Type locality:</strong> San Joaquin, Bolivia</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 70 mm (2.8\") SL</li><li><strong>Temperature:</strong> 24.0–27.0°C (75.2–80.6°F)</li><li><strong>IUCN Red List:</strong> Least Concern (last assessed 2020)</li></ul>"
